{"id":"e62bb640b0b0","publishedAt":1795260207000,"posts":[[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" すきすき！(ｽｷｽｷwwwww"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ぷわぷわ！(ﾌﾟﾜﾌﾟﾜwwwww"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"すきすき！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ぷわぷわしちゃおう！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/1/d/1d8e1aec.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"鉄ヲタのラブライバー、また横浜に行く"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"・"},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"href":"https://karukantimes.com/archives/51927635.html","text":"https://karukantimes.com/archives/51927635.html"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" あぁっ！そこにいるのは"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"6年ぶりのにこ先輩！？"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/3/2/32562476.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" いよいよこの日がやってきました！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"夜明け前から元気全開DAY DAY DAYでラブライブ15周年フェスに行ってきますぞwwwww "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" μ'sから始まって15年の間にこんなに増えてしまった‥"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/a/5/a51d0e41.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 6年前にさいたまスーパーアリーナで開催した9周年ラブライブフェスは超絶高倍率抽選でチケット難民が続出したのだが今回の会場は大容量バンデリドームとあって"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"当日見切れ席がまだ買える程度の余裕がある "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" で、肝心のボクの本日DAY1の席が！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"なんと！ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 世界最速μ's抽選でまさかのスタンド5階送りとかww"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"最速でキャパ9割は埋まってたか"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ここまでホームラン飛ばせるのが松井か福留レベルの"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"天空席で刮目したわw"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/b/f/bffa0600.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" まぁ初日は俯瞰でキャストのフォーメーションと演出をチェックして会場のグルーヴ感を楽しむのが古参の嗜みだから‥(震え "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" にゃごやだぎゃ！(適当"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/f/1/f132332c.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" さて、先ずは朝飯だな！ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 名古屋駅から徒歩数分の場所に柳橋中央市場があって"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"その中に朝からやってるラーメン屋があるのだ"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/3/a/3ac1b079.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/2/0/20d36447.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" テレビの中継？もやってた！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/8/4/844567c9.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 中華そば大河、こちらで朝飯を頂きます"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"立ち食いカウンター3席のみw"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"当然、大行列"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/2/8/286ea364.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ここは全部乗せもやし増しでキメよう"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/0/d/0d7d5763.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 並んで50分経過"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"あと少しでありつける"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/0/c/0c24f563.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" なんか増設テーブルが出てきた！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/e/d/ed4aa1dd.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" うひょーキタキタ来ましたよ！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"すっげーボリュームww"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/3/c3cd144e.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" もやし増し無料が思うてる3倍の量"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/7/3/7301b8c3.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" こら美味いわマジでw"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/4/3/439ec933.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 味玉は中沁み半熟でチャーシューも噛むとしっかり味が出る。美味い"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/5/9/59edb800.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ごっつぉーさん！"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"最高の朝飯でした。これで1100円は安い"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ライスは頼まなかたけど卓上にふりかけがあってポイント更に倍w"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/8/a/8a1f8d23.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ふぅ。いきなり名古屋の洗礼を受けた気分だぜ‥"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"岡山にはこんな店ねーだろ的な "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 1日が美味い飯で始まると幸せな気分だな！ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" さて、開場まで時間あるし名古屋城に行ってみるかなー "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 色々やってるけど動き回る元気ない‥"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/6/c603ada3.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" なんか歩いてたら途中の商店街でイベントしてた"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/1/8/18cabe2b.jpg"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" パリっぽい露店がいっぱいあって見るだけで楽しい"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/5/a/5ac54a3e.jpg"}]],"comments":["人生満開で楽しんでていいね！ｗ"]}